{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_022_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eee9e0f18ab772af0d09672992954b574d0f305bad8a9cb07f6e928c44108132",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d95f9edd3454d66bbc0db9fe2f4af50418c64fc953eac057b5036e9dc10242e6",
      "text": "突击采访夏来君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de396119044cc57f77332a868dcfe06321cb55b5267081c24395a1c1ad65b3ce",
      "text": "夏来要在面向青少年的杂志上\n刊登写真与访谈。\n他和制作人一起进行内容确认，\n但夏来的回答却似乎有些答非所问……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d95f9edd3454d66bbc0db9fe2f4af50418c64fc953eac057b5036e9dc10242e6",
      "text": "突击采访夏来君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:202d6e6e364b7bcd8bac2da219296f111c894d05875cb5e930ff1ff82557ab78",
      "text": "制作人，辛苦了。\n新工作，是什么样的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea00739a29929a46fe4c9c5fc135f8256ce41649f51fbb9f47497ac2c381e640",
      "text": "辛苦了。面向青少年的杂志编辑发来了邀约，\n希望能做一期夏来先生的特辑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:705dba38e3283944f4c930e77a31e75e5860a25564774d65910f5539e66b0223",
      "text": "给我的，特辑……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c16b2cc8a642b3da2ff76e6044424e3b296784b6e4125e5453283b3d290fcd3b",
      "text": "是的！据说是写真拍摄加访谈。\n详情请看这里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2f730058c2c8ef300ea93ac059e073a5cd9193ed2d1eeef323b49f486af3fa0",
      "text": "我知道了……虽然一个人的话有点不安……\n但我会和●●●●プロデューサー一起努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c201dbbfba71fca41b99a23dfc970d393c8ce8641ab5b46fdd72a693938ff139",
      "text": "问卷……我回答的内容……\n制作人也会帮忙确认的吧……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4bf1e678936d322ef862f3e72efda34205f46656b041e55d34c987c178a409b",
      "text": "是的，我会确认的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1ebade959c5f9605b58f6f1ecf4931363d209ac1d2374ddc6506d8477930ba0",
      "text": "那……我现在回答可以吗……？\n这样也能一起确认……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a758f0e4662fb00309f7bedb468c4a8289445671b01c71add965728c217d0e8",
      "text": "当然可以！\n那么，我们这就开始提问吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cad050d837cce6a296a7c4f9323dc640e109290e15f60094726df72f82b657a8",
      "text": "（这次的采访有很多跟恋爱相关的内容呢。\n夏来先生会给出怎样的回答呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
